      "explanation": "Original element 144 declares volumetric soil moisture m3/m3; element 51 declares specific humidity kg/kg. The reverse reader discriminates the reused 0/1/0 code by fixed surface 106. Restore this stable soil-water identity as a separate physical definition, preserving its existing name and depth restriction. Code reuse is not quantity inheritance.",
      "parameter_id": "cedarkit.sw"
    },
